WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.093
Jemima Puddle-Duck waddled down the lane.

2
00:00:05.094 --> 00:00:08.902
She went past a big bush.

3
00:00:08.903 --> 00:00:10.170
Bonk!

4
00:00:10.178 --> 00:00:13.241
Something hit her on the head.

5
00:00:13.242 --> 00:00:18.162
"Ouch!" Jemima said.

6
00:00:18.163 --> 00:00:24.177
The thing rolled into the grass.

7
00:00:24.178 --> 00:00:28.648
It was bright yellow and round.

8
00:00:28.649 --> 00:00:34.323
"An egg!" Jemima said.

9
00:00:34.324 --> 00:00:36.439
She picked it up.

10
00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:39.573
"I must hatch this egg," Jemima said.

11
00:00:39.574 --> 00:00:44.642
"I'll look for a safe place."

12
00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:50.529
Jemima hurried down the lane.

13
00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:54.264
She looked for a quiet spot.

14
00:00:54.265 --> 00:01:05.491
But noisy squirrels were everywhere.

15
00:01:05.492 --> 00:01:15.424
Jemima looked near a log.

16
00:01:15.425 --> 00:01:25.026
"Go away!" a badger said.

17
00:01:25.027 --> 00:01:30.234
"Where can I go?" Jemima thought.

18
00:01:30.235 --> 00:01:33.712
Jemima saw Rebecca and Dora.

19
00:01:33.713 --> 00:01:38.525
"Jemima!" Rebecca called.

20
00:01:38.526 --> 00:01:40.706
"We're going to the pond.

21
00:01:40.707 --> 00:01:42.804
Come with us!"

22
00:01:42.805 --> 00:01:46.324
Jemima smiled. "I wish I could.

23
00:01:46.325 --> 00:01:49.656
But I have an important job."

24
00:01:49.657 --> 00:01:53.029
"What job?" Dora asked.

25
00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:56.424
"I must hatch an egg," Jemima said.

26
00:01:56.425 --> 00:01:59.504
Jemima showed the egg to the other ducks.

27
00:01:59.505 --> 00:02:04.192
Rebecca and Dora laughed.

28
00:02:04.193 --> 00:02:08.639
Jemima frowned. "What is so funny?"

29
00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.963
"Silly Jemima!" Rebecca said.

30
00:02:11.964 --> 00:02:13.668
"That's not an egg.

31
00:02:13.669 --> 00:02:24.025
It's a ball!"

